{
    "background_story": "Duke was a humble firefighter who became an unlikely heroine in the eyes of the community. During a devastating warehouse fire, he risked his life to rescue a family of four trapped inside. With flames engulfing the building, Duke entered the inferno, navigating through thick smoke and debris to reach the family. He carried the children to safety, then went back for their parents, refusing to leave until everyone was accounted for. Duke's bravery and selflessness inspired the entire town, earning him the title of 'Hero of the Year.' Despite his newfound fame, Duke remained humble, crediting his training and teamwork for the successful rescue. His heroism had a lasting impact, inspiring a new generation of first responders and cementing his place as a true heroine in the hearts of the people.",
